# Godot builds to download, one entry per line:
#
#   <minor>  <version>  <sha256>  [<templates-sha256>]
#
# <minor>            install directory, e.g. 4.7 (point releases share one
#                    directory so upgrades replace in place with a smaller
#                    footprint).
# <version>          godot-builds release tag, e.g. 4.7.2-stable or 4.8-dev6.
#                    May be omitted: the newest release for <minor> is then
#                    resolved from the godot-builds git tags.
# <sha256>           checksum of the Linux x86_64 zip. May be omitted: it is
#                    then taken from the godot-builds release manifest for
#                    <version>, which records the sha512 of every asset.
# <templates-sha256> optional checksum of the export templates .tpz, used when
#                    GODOT_TEMPLATES=1; likewise filled from the release
#                    manifest when omitted.
#
# These are Linux x86_64 builds only.

